The exposition writer and scrape loop (src/prometheus_exporter/exposition.uc and
scrape.uc) are modeled on the ucode package's files/metrics.uc; the uhttpd
handler, init script, config and package Makefile derive from its
files/metrics.uc, files/init, files/config and Makefile.

Metric names and help texts follow the Prometheus node_exporter
(https://github.com/prometheus/node_exporter), Copyright 2013-2015 The
Prometheus Authors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; the
textfile collector also follows node_exporter's textfile collector. The
diskstats and sockstat collectors port node_exporter's diskstats and sockstat
collectors (collector/diskstats_linux.go, sockstat_linux.go) and how the
Prometheus procfs library (https://github.com/prometheus/procfs, Copyright
The Prometheus Authors, Apache License, Version 2.0) parses /proc/diskstats
and /proc/net/sockstat; diskstats' default device_exclude extends
node_exporter's default --collector.diskstats.device-exclude.

The chrony collector's metric names, labels and help texts follow
chrony_exporter (https://github.com/SuperQ/chrony_exporter), Copyright 2022
Ben Kochie, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
